cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use McpFrisk in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "McpFrisk"
abstract: >-
  A pre-deploy / CI security scanner (linter) for Model Context Protocol (MCP)
  server source code. It runs before release, catching vulnerabilities while the
  author can still fix them, with a stdlib-only core and evidence-grounded
  findings mapped to OWASP MCP Top 10 and CWE.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Obermueller"
    given-names: "Imre"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Imre7777/mcpfrisk"
url: "https://github.com/Imre7777/mcpfrisk"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
keywords:
  - mcp
  - model-context-protocol
  - security
  - static-analysis
  - linter
  - ci
